---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Zero to Hero — Free Intake Strategy Call for Law Firm Owners"
  description="The five-level build from a solo founder answering his own phone to 65,000+ intakes processed. Book a 30-minute call and find out which level you're on."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Zero to Hero",
    "description": "A 30-minute intake strategy call for law firm owners, based on the five-level build behind 65,000+ processed intakes.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            Zero to <span class="text-gradient-gold">Hero.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            How one law firm went from a solo founder answering his own phone to 65,000+ intakes processed and 140+ employees &mdash; the five-level build, told in the firm's own published numbers.
          </p>

          <!-- Stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="65">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">K+</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">intakes processed since the founder answered his own phone</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="22">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">call attempts the firm works to before a lead is marked dead</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="140">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">+</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">staff hired since, with virtually no turnover</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What the call covers -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Which of the five levels you're actually on</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Founder-as-intake through 24/7 coverage &mdash; and the exact next one to build.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.306a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.518l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">What your intake gap is costing you annually</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Leads &times; miss rate &times; close rate &times; fee &mdash; we'll run your number live.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The 22-touch cadence that signs cases others let go cold</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">The exact schedule behind a 10&ndash;15 touch close, not the 1&ndash;3 most firms stop at.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; 30 minutes
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Built inside a working law firm
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Intake Review</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/magnet-zero-to-hero?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OPENING — the story + the four failure modes
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">The Build, Not The Theory</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            In January 2022, this firm did not exist.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            No cases. No staff. One lawyer answering his own phone.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Since then: 65,000+ intakes processed, 3,716 clients signed, 140+ internal employees with virtually no turnover among the staff they wanted to keep. That didn't happen because of a bigger ad budget. It happened because the phone got answered and the follow-up never stopped.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            You don't have a lead problem. You have an operations problem.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: the four failure modes -->
        <div class="reveal space-y-4" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-1">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">1 &middot; Intake Failure</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Calls go to voicemail. Leads sit overnight. Nobody owns the phone. Tell: voicemails older than 24 hours, right now.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-2">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">2 &middot; Follow-Up Gaps</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">One attempt, maybe two, then silence. Signing a case takes 10 to 15 touches. Most firms can't say how many times they called their last ten no-answers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-3">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">3 &middot; Admin Chaos</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Attorneys doing $20 work at $400 rates &mdash; records, file opening, calendar, CRM cleanup &mdash; every single day, without noticing it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card" style="animation: lpSlideIn 0.5s ease 0.55s both;">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143 1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 3.75l3 3m0 0l-3 3m3-3h-7.5" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">4 &middot; Scaling Bottleneck</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">More marketing spend pouring into the same capacity to absorb it. Ad spend goes up, signed-case count barely moves.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner mt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;18 seconds later, that caller signed with the firm down the street.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE LEAK MATH
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">Do This Before You Read Further</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          What your intake gap costs you this year.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Four numbers. Two minutes. You will not need a calculator.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 reveal mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">A</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Leads per month</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Every inbound call, form fill, chat, and referral. All of them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">B</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">% missed or mishandled</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Use your real number. If you don't have one, use 20% &mdash; conservative next to the 34.8% unanswered rate measured during business hours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">C</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Your signed-case rate</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Of the leads you do reach, what percentage sign? Most firms land between 15% and 35%.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">D</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Average case value</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Your number. Fee, not gross recovery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-rule-box max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="lp-rule-box-label">The Formula</span>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading text-brand-navy font-mono">A &times; B &times; C &times; D = monthly leak &rarr; &times; 12 = annual leak</p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal mb-10 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-brand-navy text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-5 py-3 flex justify-between">
          <span>Worked Example</span>
          <span class="text-white/60 normal-case font-normal">60 leads/mo, $15,000 avg. fee</span>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 text-sm">
            <span class="text-gray-600">Leads per month</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">60</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 text-sm">
            <span class="text-gray-600">Missed or mishandled at 20%</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">12 leads</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 text-sm">
            <span class="text-gray-600">Of those, would have signed at 25%</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">3 cases</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 text-sm">
            <span class="text-gray-600">At $15,000 average fee</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">$45,000 / mo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 bg-brand-gold/10">
            <span class="font-heading text-gray-900">Annualized</span>
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl text-brand-navy">$540,000</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal mb-10">
        &ldquo;$540,000 is not a marketing budget problem. One additional intake seat costs a fraction of that.&rdquo;
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-lg font-heading text-gray-900 max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        Run your own number before the call. Everything else is an opinion until you have it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE FIVE LEVELS
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">The Build</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5">
          Zero to Hero, <span class="text-gradient-gold">one level at a time.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Nobody jumps from a solo practice to a 140-person operation. Find your level. Build the next one. Don't skip.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-14">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-40 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">0</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Level 0</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">The founder is the intake team</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">You answer, you qualify, you sign, then you do the legal work. Breaks at 8 to 12 calls a week.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-40 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-blue font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest">Level 1 &middot; Frontline</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
